2526
02:30:49,811 --> 02:31:17,811
Sense of direction. Yes, I'll add it. It's E, right? It's the sense of direction, very good. The sense of direction allows you to shift your focus from quantity, to quality, to quality. Az olsun, öz olsun, bizim olsun. Anyway, now let's read paragraph 3. Improved focus and effectiveness.

